apostles, therefore, did preach the Son of God, of whom men were ignorant; ...
Can it really be, that Peter was not at that time as yet in possession of the
perfect knowledge which these men discovered afterwards? According to them,
therefore, Peter was imperfect, and the rest of the apostles were imperfect
; and so it would be fitting that they, coming to life again, should become
